- resilience.rs (new): EscalationStage/escalation_stage_of (§91) built
  entirely from existing CandidateState/SetupCost/TransportKind::Dtn;
  timeout_millis_for_stage (§92); HedgePolicy/hedge_policy_for (§93);
  RouteDiagnostics/diagnose + RejectionReason (§95, scoped to the two
  rejection checks doable without an external policy object)
- plan.rs: RouteStrategy gains a Hedged variant, RoutePlan gains
  hedge_delay_millis; plan_route now actually produces Hedged for
  high-priority non-bulk non-delay-tolerant traffic with a fallback
  available; 3 new integration tests (hedged plan produced correctly,
  bulk transfers never hedge, diagnose() end-to-end)
- descriptor.rs: OperationId's existing §72 dedup doc comment extended
  to cover Hedged alongside Redundant (§94, no new code needed)
- cache.rs, dispatch.rs: mechanical hedge_delay_millis: None added to
  the two other RoutePlan literal construction sites
- lib.rs: mod resilience; + updated doc-comment coverage map for
  §91-96; also fixed a real content gap left over from round 7's own
  edit (a dropped sentence fragment leaving a dangling section
  reference)
- §96 "Path Visualization" documented as out-of-scope - the spec
  itself defers it to "Part 18"

119/119 tests (up from 106), clippy clean, fmt clean, doc-warning-free
(two broken intra-doc links to private items fixed). Zero regressions
in siar-dtn-bundle (37/37)/siar-identity-multidevice (251/251)/
siar-protocol-ext (115/115).
